  "message": "It looks like you have used 15.1GB of data this cycle, which is over your plan's 15GB data limit. This is why you have no data connection right now. You can add more data (up to 2GB) to restore your connection. Would you like to refuel your data now? Let me know how much data (up to 2GB) you would like to add, and I can help you with that."
