  "message": "Thank you for checking. Since your phone shows full signal and 5G with data enabled, but you still have no internet connection, the next step is to check your phone's APN (Access Point Name) settings. Incorrect APN settings can prevent your phone from accessing mobile data. Please check your APN settings and let me know if anything looks incorrect or if you see a missing MMSC URL. If you're unsure, I can guide you to reset your APN settings to default."
